---
---
<section class="relative bg-black py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 100%, rgba(255,209,0,0.07) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div>
      <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-4">Coming Up Next After the Webinar</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
        The 3-Day Camp That<br>Takes It <em class="italic text-[#FFD100]">All the Way</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-white/55 leading-relaxed mb-8 font-light">The webinar is the beginning. For parents who want to go deeper, our 3-day virtual faith-based financial literacy camp gives your teen an immersive, structured experience that builds lasting habits not just one-day inspiration.</p>
      <ul class="flex flex-col mb-8">
        {[
          'God\'s purpose for wealth not just how to earn it',
          'Budgeting, saving, and managing money with intention',
          'Investing basics and how to start before they turn 21',
          'How to avoid debt, peer pressure, and get-rich-quick traps',
          '4 quarterly follow-up sessions post-camp so it actually sticks',
        ].map((item) => (
          <li class="text-sm text-white/55 py-3 border-b border-white/5 pl-5 relative before:content-['→'] before:absolute before:left-0 before:text-[#FFD100]">{item}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <a href="https://themoneywit.africa/school/mwbs" class="inline-block bg-[#FFD100] text-black px-10 py-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase hover:brightness-110 transition-all">
        Learn About the Camp →
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      {[
        { label: 'Camp Name', val: 'Money Wise Bible Strong' },
        { label: 'Dates', val: 'August 12–14, 2026', sub: '4PM GMT+1 Daily · Virtual' },
        { label: 'Who It\'s For', val: 'Young Adults · Ages 16–21' },
        { label: 'Investment', val: '₦140,000 / $100', sub: 'Split payment available · Limited spots' },
      ].map((tag) => (
        <div class="bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-white/5 border-l-4 border-l-[#FFD100] p-5">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white/30 mb-1">{tag.label}</div>
          <div class="text-base font-bold text-white">{tag.val}</div>
          {tag.sub && <div class="text-xs text-white/30 mt-1">{tag.sub}</div>}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
